      "created_at": "2016-11-29T02:29:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm sad we cannot \"Guise of Knowledge\" anymore. :CThank you, MigrantP, for keeping all this stuff compiled and updated for us!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I generally don't go for house rules, but at my table, if Guise's player wants to use Haka of Knowledge to discard Guise the Barbarian, I am absolutely going to let them anyway.</p>",
